            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Bumps <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred\">@mdn/fred</a> from 1.8.1 to 1.9.0.</p>\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/releases\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​mdn/fred</code>'s releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">v1.9.0</h2>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/compare/v1.8.1...v1.9.0\">1.9.0</a> (2025-11-18)</h2>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Features</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>compat-table:</strong> render only visible timeline on click (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1057\">#1057</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/commit/33b6efeaf8a05a302d9acf01b03ab099dcc5621f\">33b6efe</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>compat-table:</strong> toggle timeline with click (<a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/commit/33b6efeaf8a05a302d9acf01b03ab099dcc5621f\">33b6efe</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>compat-table:</strong> show message when JavaScript is disabled (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mdn/fred/issues/890\">#890</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/commit/3ac4661a1c6985337416d38500e0abeb96f8e77a\">3ac4661</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>menu:</strong> mark \"MDN on GitHub\" link as external (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mdn/fred/issues/830\">#830</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/commit/dc32ba4a7644fa51d5752fd0bf51e16bbdab976e\">dc32ba4</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Miscellaneous</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>deps-dev:</strong> bump <a href=\"https://github.com/zip\"><code class=\"notranslate\">@​zip</code></a>.js/zip.js from 2.8.8 to 2.8.10 in the dev group (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/mdn/fred/issues/1065\">#1065</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/fred/commit/5be28cce86c5dfe9f6a3417e61f6e